{"ref":"character:maria-renard","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Maria Renard is a playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Guardian's_Targe.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"weapon:guardian-s-targe"}," ",{"t":"Guardian's Targe","r":"weapon:guardian-s-targe"},". Upon unlocking the ",{"i":"Sprite-Spectral_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spectral-sword"}," ",{"t":"Spectral Sword","r":"weapon:spectral-sword"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Belnades'_Spellbook.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," ",{"t":"Belnades' Spellbook","r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"},", Maria can start with either weapon selector as an alternate starting weapon via ",{"i":"Sprite-Mindbender.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:mindbender"}," ",{"t":"skin selection","r":"relic:mindbender"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Maria"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_MARIAA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Maria_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Guardian's_Targe.png","w":14,"h":16,"r":"weapon:guardian-s-targe"}," ",{"t":"Guardian's Targe","r":"weapon:guardian-s-targe"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Complete any stage with Shanoa and Juste Belmont."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Filippo_Vicarelli.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Moonlight Nocturne - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+25%"]]},{"label":"Luck","cells":[["+25%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Maria Renard can be unlocked by completing any stage with both ",{"i":"Sprite-Shanoa.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"character:shanoa"}," ",{"t":"Shanoa","r":"character:shanoa"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Juste_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:juste-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Juste Belmont","r":"character:juste-belmont"},". She is then available for purchase for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000, scaling on other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Maria can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"holyglasses\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Maria starts with +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +25% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", and +25% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Overhealing will addivitely increase her Might by log(0.001*OverhealingAmount)."]},{"k":"p","c":["At levels 2, 12, 22, and 32 Maria gains a follower, namely the ",{"t":"Sacred Cardinal","r":"weapon:familiar-forge"},", the ",{"t":"Sacred Dragon","r":"weapon:familiar-forge"},", the ",{"t":"Sacred Tiger","r":"weapon:familiar-forge"},", and the ",{"t":"Sacred Turtle","r":"weapon:familiar-forge"}," followers. They will stay at the fixed north, east, south and west positions around her."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["These familiars won't take damage."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Overhealing by +32 will trigger a ",{"i":"Sprite-Mirror_of_Truth.png","w":19,"h":24}," Mirror of Truth and ",{"i":"Sprite-Rapid_Fire.png","w":24,"h":18}," Rapid Fire for all of her followers."]},{"k":"p","c":["She can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Maria_Renard.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Maria Renard's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Maria_Renard.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Maria_Renard_-_trailer.png","w":223,"h":225,"c":["Maria Renard as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aGAlK-DIeAE"}," of Ode to Castlevania."]},{"i":"Ode_to_Castlevania_short_-_Maria_sheet.png","w":300,"h":153,"c":["Official Ode to Castlevania pre-release trailer model sheet."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The spell required to unlock her, \"holyglasses\" is a nod to Symphony of the Night where she gives the Holy Glasses to ",{"t":"Alucard","r":"character:alucard"}," to help him see ",{"t":"Shaft","r":"character:shaft"},"'s orb controlling ",{"t":"Richter","r":"character:richter-belmont"},"."]},{"c":["The four familiars that she gains are a reference to her animal companions used as sub-weapons as ",{"t":"Young Maria","r":"character:young-maria-renard"}," in Rondo of Blood: the cat, turtle, cardinals, and dragon."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Maria Renard","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Maria_